+- `-Action TestApp`: **96 checks, zero failures**.
+- `-Action TestScript -ScriptPath res://tests/test_script_parse.gd`: **275 scripts, zero failures**.
+- `git diff --check -- game/core/app.gd`: passed, existing CRLF normalization notice only.
+
+Inspected [Garage held pull](evidence/menu-end-effects-2026-10-04/edge-garage-960x540.png); [Race held pull](evidence/menu-end-effects-2026-10-04/edge-tracks-960x540.png) captures the opposite edge. Evidence uses isolated synthetic gallery data. Phone deployment and verification are recorded below. Full Validate/replay, gameplay driving, sustained device performance and human finger/feel acceptance are outside these checks. No backend or service action.
